---
#3959, capability parameters slice 1: a commons that selects a capability no function's
`given` names gets `bynk.commons.capability_unused`, a warning: the selection brings in a
contract and nothing else, so an unused one misleads a reader about what the library reaches.
---
commons lib.cache

consumes bynk.cloudflare { Kv }

fn key(id: String) -> String {
	"session:\(id)"
}
